.* WRKOBJOWN: the objects a user profile owns, with their options.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Quartz Systems 2026
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=AUTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=USRPRF CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJAUT CLASS=AUTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJS VARS='OPT OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE OBJAUT'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKOBJOWN KEYL=KEYS HELP=WRKOOWNH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Objects by Owner
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.User profile . . . . . . . :   &USRPRF.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD EDTOBJAUT OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)'.2=Edit authority
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPOBJAUT OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)'.5=Display authority
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='CMD ?RNMOBJ OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)'.7=Rename
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD DSPOBJD OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.) DETAIL(*FULL)'.8=Display description
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD ?CHGOBJOWN OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)'.9=Change owner
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJAUT USAGE=OUTPUT.Authority
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKOOWNH.Work with Objects by Owner - Help
:P.Every object the user profile owns, with the owner's authority to
it. Type an option next to an object and press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F5 reads the
objects again.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
